    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Pirate's Money, the ultimate adventure on the seven seas, where strategy, courage and cunning determine who will reign over the treacherous waters of Pirate's Island!<br><br><strong>Ranked: Where Legends Are Forged</strong><br>With the <strong><u>Ranked Pass</u></strong>, you not only test your skills against <strong>the best pirates</strong>, but you also have the chance to engrave your name in the history of Pirate's Island. Each season, the seas become a battlefield where only the most cunning survive.<br><br><br><strong>Stunning Graphics and Immersive Gameplay</strong><br>With breathtaking graphics and immersive gameplay, you'll feel every wave crashing against the hull, the wind in your sails and the sweet taste of victory. Every choice, every battle, every negotiation is a story you write in Pirate's Money.<br><br><strong>Community and Competitions</strong><br>Join a vibrant community of pirates! Make alliances, betray enemies and fight for the top. With regular updates, seasonal events, and a world that evolves with your actions, every visit to Pirate's Money is a new adventure.<br><br>Your legend begins now. Raise the sails, load the cannons and prepare for the adventure of a lifetime in Pirate's Money.",
